{{Term/Store|Soldier's Greaves|Soldier's Greaves|Series, BotW, TotK, AoC|plural}} are recurring [[Item]]s in {{TLoZ Series}}.{{Exp Game|BotW, TotK, AoC}}<ref name="BotW Inventory"/><ref name="TotK Inventory"/><ref name="AoC Allies"/>

==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Descriptions BotW}}
Soldier's Greaves can be purchased at the [[Ventest Clothing Boutique]] in [[Hateno Village]]. They are part of the [[Soldier's Set]], along with the [[Soldier's Helm]] and [[Soldier's Armor]]. Wearing them provides no bonus aside from an increased [[Defense]]. Soldier's Greaves can be both enhanced by a [[Great Fairy]] and [[Dye]]d at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]].

